    "reason": "Preserves OA's deterministic last-axis TopK, dense membership mask, stable dropless expert-major route plan, device-resident auxiliary-loss-free routing-bias update, rank-one through rank-four FP32 Slice and variadic Concat over the shared copy-region algorithm, Slice's zero-padded adjoint, RepeatInterleave with its reduction adjoint, last-axis indexed gather with its deterministic reduction adjoint, and FP32 scalar equality masks used by donor adjoints. The RepeatInterleave adjoint corrects the donor's non-leading-axis coordinate decomposition by using input dimensions and output strides. MoeExpertPlan uses OARS compatibility ID 359 because donor-local ID 315 was already assigned to RnnCell before this family landed. MoeRoutingBiasUpdate uses OARS compatibility ID 372 because donor-local ID 311 was already assigned to GruScan. Slice, SliceBackward, and Concat use OARS compatibility IDs 376-378 because the donor registry does not publish numeric kernel identities for MatrixCopyRegion. GatherLastDim and its adjoint use OARS compatibility IDs 388-389 because donor-local IDs 319-320 were already assigned to batched matrix multiplication. Equal uses OARS compatibility ID 393 because its donor registry identity is not globally unique in OARS."
  },
